  - New rule: IFSManipulation (high) — IFS= overrides and $IFS-bound
    expansions
  - New rule: DangerousExpansion (high) — ${!var}, ${var@P},
    ${var=value}, nested $(...) in ${...} (CVE-2026-29783 class)
  - New rule: ReverseShellSink (high) — nc -e, ncat -e, socat exec:,
    bash -i with /dev/tcp, ssh ProxyCommand, mkfifo
  - New rule: DangerousFilesystem (high/medium) — dd of=/dev/sdX,
